### Test Master Database Login (SuperAdmin)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/Authentication/Login-User
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "superadmin",
  "password": "SuperAdmin@123"
}

### Test Tenant Database Login (requires X-Tenant-ID header)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/Authentication/Login-User
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

{
  "userName": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "TestUser@123"
}

### Register User in Master Database (no tenant header)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/Authentication/Register-User
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Master",
  "lastName": "Admin",
  "email": "masteradmin@example.com",
  "password": "MasterAdmin@123",
  "confirmPassword": "MasterAdmin@123"
}

### Register User in Tenant Database (with tenant header)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/Authentication/Register-User
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}

{
  "firstName": "Tenant",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "tenantuser@example.com",
  "password": "TenantUser@123",
  "confirmPassword": "TenantUser@123"
}

### Get Tenants (requires master authentication)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/Tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{masterToken}}